offset 0 |\n\nThe rejection results are preserved. CallerA\u2019s `0b0a` confirms `g1` wins when both checks would fail; trailing-input cases confirm end-of-input rejection precedes computation.\n\n**Stopped after the base stage. No successor or migration was created.**", "time": {"start": 1791577832391, "end": 1791577845112}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0041c0f69d4bd307016ac94ee8fdfc819b82e8c5e6d691d7c8", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
